tools.description:
Full-text search across all askWheat resources (genes, germplasm, genotyping datasets, files).

Filters (exact values): database e.g. 'Ensembl Plants', 'Watkins Wheat Pangenome', 'CropSNPdb', 'GBIF genebank accessions';
entry_type e.g. 'Gene annotation', 'Germplasm', 'Genotyping Experiment', 'File';
species e.g. 'Triticum aestivum'. Returns total count, facet counts and the top hits with source URLs.

Position(s) of a genetic marker (90K/80K/9K iSelect, 35K Axiom, KASP, DArT, SSR e.g. 'BS00000713', 'wmc617', 'Xgwm149';
40K array IDs such as 'IWB61980' or 'AVRIG14047' come from CropSNPdb)
on IWGSC RefSeq v2.1 (IWGSC GMAP alignments), with genes within +/- flank bp of each hit.
